WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.380
didn't say that clearly again. Let me say it differently. To live life at a low standard

2
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:19.500
does not require Jesus, because God does not have low standards. When I'm a so-called Christian,

3
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:27.080
but my life is worldly, I do not need Jesus to live a worldly life, even though I come

4
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:37.520
to church every weekend. And so many of us have put Jesus out of business, because you

5
00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:43.640
don't need him to dress like the world. You don't need him to eat like the world. You

6
00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:48.280
don't need Jesus Christ to conduct your romance like the world. You don't need Jesus Christ

7
00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:53.500
to spend your money like the world. You don't need Jesus to live a worldly life dressed

8
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:59.020
in Christian clothes. Low standards make Jesus
